   <narrative xml:lang="SV">JPO UNDP 2014 USA/Thailand DIG/M&amp;E KL</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insatsen har den tematiska inriktingen m&#xe4;nsklig s&#xe4;kerhet. Tj&#xe4;nsten innefattar tillsyn och utv&#xe4;rdering av projekt som bek&#xe4;mpar m&#xe4;nniskohandel. JPO-tj&#xe4;nsten &#xe4;r vald i samband med Sida och UNDP. Omr&#xe5;det monitoring/evaluation &#xe4;r av stor vikt f&#xf6;r Sida. Framtidsm&#xf6;jligheter inom FN systsemet b&#xf6;r vara goda med en tr&#xe5;rog erfarenhet fr&#xe5;n UNDP.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Thematic area of the contribution is human security and protection. The position comprises monitoring and evaluation of anti-human trafficking projects. JPO program (Junior Professional Officers) is an important part of    the total Swedish focus on increased Swedish participation in international organizations. The program offers young graduates the   opportunity to serve in the UN and other international organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
